### 1. Review Current Patterns
**Before making changes:**
- Review existing service implementations (Adnic, GIG, Liva, Alliance)
- Identify patterns used in current implementations
- Ensure new code follows established architectural patterns
- Check consistency with Single Responsibility Principle
